1
00:01:59,473 --> 00:02:03,783
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:04,373 --> 00:02:08,513
No living creature was hurt during
the production of this show.

3
00:02:10,395 --> 00:02:12,765
Three days later

4
00:03:16,272 --> 00:03:19,012
Your messenger is coming, my Sultan.

5
00:03:20,967 --> 00:03:23,777
Soldiers!
Wait!

6
00:03:49,321 --> 00:03:50,551
Tell me.

7
00:03:50,715 --> 00:03:55,775
My Sultan, as you command, Osman
Bey has welcomed me.

8
00:03:55,905 --> 00:04:00,355
Your tent has been set up.

9
00:04:00,799 --> 00:04:02,819
They are waiting for you.

10
00:04:03,155 --> 00:04:06,545
Tell me, how are Ghazis?

11
00:04:06,743 --> 00:04:10,763
Are the soldiers worried or cheerful?

12
00:04:11,385 --> 00:04:17,024
My Sultan, all Gaziyans (a religious and
military team) are cheerful.

13
00:04:17,575 --> 00:04:19,675
Osman Bey also is.

14
00:04:19,885 --> 00:04:25,365
All Ghazis respect Osman Bey.

15
00:04:25,746 --> 00:04:28,786
They say it's an honor for them...

16
00:04:29,106 --> 00:04:32,566
to fight for Osman Bey's tent.

17
00:04:35,155 --> 00:04:37,315
(There is no winner but Allah.)

18
00:05:34,827 --> 00:05:36,877
Where are you, Aygül?

19
00:05:38,544 --> 00:05:40,534
She will be here soon with my Bey.

20
00:05:43,026 --> 00:05:45,596
Why are you so impatient, Cerkutay?

21
00:05:48,425 --> 00:05:50,135
I am.

22
00:05:50,273 --> 00:05:53,753
I am impatient than ever, brother.

23
00:05:55,465 --> 00:05:59,465
I am walking on air.

24
00:06:07,135 --> 00:06:09,675
We'll take revenge on Byzantine.

25
00:06:10,161 --> 00:06:12,241
We'll take their ammunition.

26
00:06:13,019 --> 00:06:15,299
And...

27
00:06:15,975 --> 00:06:17,555
And?

28
00:06:25,474 --> 00:06:26,834
And...

29
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:31,599
I'll prepare a trousseau. (dowry)

30
00:06:32,176 --> 00:06:34,106
I'll prepare a trousseau.

31
00:06:44,953 --> 00:06:46,133
Alps.

32
00:06:47,478 --> 00:06:49,368
What is the situation?

33
00:06:52,818 --> 00:06:55,788
They kept changing their
places all night.

34
00:06:56,575 --> 00:07:01,445
They are having a rest now. They will go
to military quarters at night.

35
00:07:15,342 --> 00:07:18,462
They have lots of trophies and ammunition.

36
00:07:22,387 --> 00:07:26,857
They look exhausted, my Bey.

37
00:07:27,941 --> 00:07:31,401
We can walk all over them, my Bey.

38
00:07:39,347 --> 00:07:41,157
They have lots of ammunition.

39
00:07:41,805 --> 00:07:43,985
However, they are crowded too.

40
00:07:46,258 --> 00:07:48,628
Should we tell Alps, Osman Bey?

41
00:07:48,969 --> 00:07:51,379
Four to one, brother.

42
00:07:52,255 --> 00:07:55,535
A wolf can harm four jackals.

43
00:07:56,026 --> 00:08:00,746
Look.
Cerkutay is out of his patience.

44
00:08:06,807 --> 00:08:08,297
Come on.

45
00:08:09,281 --> 00:08:12,701
Sultan is about to arrive. We
shouldn't lose much time.

46
00:08:13,758 --> 00:08:17,448
- Brother. Stay with the archers.
- Okay, Osman Bey.

47
00:08:18,193 --> 00:08:22,193
Aygül Hatun will take care of others.

48
00:08:22,493 --> 00:08:24,063
Okay, my Bey.

49
00:08:59,441 --> 00:09:03,441
Allah is eternal!

50
00:09:07,118 --> 00:09:10,518
Turks! Damn!
Battle order!

51
00:09:34,387 --> 00:09:36,167
Osman is weak.

52
00:09:36,441 --> 00:09:38,741
The battle will be his end.

53
00:09:38,804 --> 00:09:41,904
I wish it was that easy, Dukas.

54
00:09:42,585 --> 00:09:45,455
He has nothing to trust
except for Sultan's army.

55
00:09:46,439 --> 00:09:49,459
He will trust the
thing he has trusted till today.

56
00:09:50,493 --> 00:09:53,523
It's the first time that Sultan's
army is coming.

57
00:09:53,625 --> 00:09:56,495
Those who lose their
hope before the war...

58
00:09:57,412 --> 00:10:00,262
shouldn't join the battle.

59
00:10:01,100 --> 00:10:03,890
I am sure that we'll win the war.

60
00:10:04,655 --> 00:10:08,845
I don't know who will die or not.

61
00:10:20,628 --> 00:10:24,038
The military camp has been
set up near Domaniç, sir.

62
00:10:24,196 --> 00:10:26,816
What about the support unit? Ammunition?

63
00:10:26,939 --> 00:10:29,159
They are there.

64
00:10:29,648 --> 00:10:32,858
They will bring the ammunition to the
military quarters tonight.

65
00:10:33,885 --> 00:10:37,885
Let's go then.
Victory is waiting for us.

66
00:10:51,355 --> 00:10:54,605
Don't run away!

67
00:12:27,923 --> 00:12:29,783
Die, Osman!

68
00:12:33,669 --> 00:12:36,229
Say that to my sword.

69
00:13:23,597 --> 00:13:25,077
My Bey.

70
00:13:31,542 --> 00:13:32,792
Alps.

71
00:13:36,622 --> 00:13:39,122
- You're happy, Cerkutay.
- Of course I am.

72
00:13:39,401 --> 00:13:43,911
I was thinking about the dowery but
the emperor's army already prepared it.

73
00:13:55,085 --> 00:13:59,035
It's time for you to marry a halal Hatun.

74
00:14:18,085 --> 00:14:20,115
Yes, my Bey.

75
00:14:26,674 --> 00:14:28,014
Yes.

76
00:14:29,131 --> 00:14:30,511
Osman Bey.

77
00:14:30,913 --> 00:14:32,813
Dukas and Nikola will be surprised...

78
00:14:33,034 --> 00:14:38,754
when they learn about the
ammunition and support unit.

79
00:14:39,298 --> 00:14:42,848
- However, Leo...
- They don't know about Leo.

80
00:14:43,373 --> 00:14:47,373
They trapped us.

81
00:14:47,774 --> 00:14:49,144
However...

82
00:14:49,477 --> 00:14:54,517
I will punish Dukas during the war.

83
00:15:02,117 --> 00:15:03,907
- Göktuğ!
- My Bey.

84
00:15:03,966 --> 00:15:07,416
Bring the ammunition to
Sultan's military quarters.

85
00:15:07,672 --> 00:15:09,032
Your command, my Bey.

86
00:15:09,092 --> 00:15:11,742
Let's go.

87
00:15:13,691 --> 00:15:15,231
Come on.

88
00:15:36,606 --> 00:15:40,266
- How are you?
- I'm fine, Ayşe Hatun.

89
00:15:41,345 --> 00:15:45,285
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam.

90
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:52,370
Malhun Hatun, we heard that
you're pregnant.

91
00:15:55,719 --> 00:15:58,899
May Allah let your child grow up with
his/her mother and father.

92
00:15:59,505 --> 00:16:02,865
We have gifts for you.

93
00:16:03,082 --> 00:16:05,802
Thank you, Hatuns.

94
00:16:10,345 --> 00:16:12,475
Thank you.

95
00:16:16,375 --> 00:16:19,905
Come here, let's drink our Sherbet
and talk.

96
00:16:21,537 --> 00:16:24,827
Zoe, bring Sherbet to our guests.

97
00:16:57,665 --> 00:16:58,745
Mashallah.

98
00:17:19,980 --> 00:17:23,910
Osman Bey has been waiting for
this good news for a long time.

99
00:17:24,926 --> 00:17:29,687
Not just our Bey, also our tent.
Thank Allah we have seen these days.

100
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,560
Hatuns.

101
00:17:36,154 --> 00:17:39,064
Everyone wants to know...

102
00:17:39,354 --> 00:17:41,884
who their words are heard by.

103
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:49,840
If you excuse us.

104
00:17:59,148 --> 00:18:03,048
I want to talk to you if you excuse me.

105
00:18:05,422 --> 00:18:08,372
I have some work to do.
If you excuse me.

106
00:18:09,670 --> 00:18:13,310
Zoe, Alaca.
Help me.

107
00:18:20,192 --> 00:18:22,962
What's the matter, Bala Hatun?

108
00:18:31,417 --> 00:18:32,587
Zoe.

109
00:18:35,945 --> 00:18:38,085
I suspect her.

110
00:18:39,625 --> 00:18:40,745
Why?

111
00:18:41,537 --> 00:18:44,687
She told Gonca that she went to
a draper store in Söğüt.

112
00:18:45,661 --> 00:18:47,661
However, she didn't.

113
00:18:52,055 --> 00:18:53,925
Not just that.

114
00:18:54,238 --> 00:18:56,868
She disappears a lot.

115
00:18:58,685 --> 00:19:01,255
Be careful.

116
00:19:14,614 --> 00:19:18,094
Does Osman Bey's Hatun...

117
00:19:18,807 --> 00:19:21,697
spy out the woman who helps me?

118
00:19:26,261 --> 00:19:31,411
You're angry because
I let Zoe in the tent.

119
00:19:34,819 --> 00:19:37,809
However, you don't have to worry.
I trust her.

120
00:19:40,225 --> 00:19:44,225
I told you what I thougt.
It's up to you now.

121
00:20:48,197 --> 00:20:50,727
Soldier!
What happened?

122
00:20:58,939 --> 00:21:01,879
What happened, soldier?

123
00:21:02,477 --> 00:21:04,797
All of the soldiers are dead.

124
00:21:06,171 --> 00:21:09,821
- What about the ammunition?
- They took it.

125
00:21:11,639 --> 00:21:14,899
Damn you, Osman!

126
00:21:15,306 --> 00:21:19,086
You were wondering why
Osman didn't respond to our raid.

127
00:21:19,557 --> 00:21:21,447
That's why!

128
00:21:22,270 --> 00:21:26,270
- We've lost our superiority!
- We are still superior.

129
00:21:30,478 --> 00:21:33,688
We've lost the support
unit and the ammunition.

130
00:21:33,870 --> 00:21:37,390
I've sent them in
two different ways!

131
00:21:39,580 --> 00:21:43,050
Helen must have sent the other
half of the ammunition to the quarters.

132
00:21:56,383 --> 00:21:57,183
Talk.

133
00:21:57,235 --> 00:22:00,375
Sultan's army is about to
arrive.

134
00:22:08,707 --> 00:22:10,497
To the horses!

135
00:23:00,613 --> 00:23:03,293
Alps!
Get ready!

136
00:23:50,554 --> 00:23:52,794
Welcome, my Sultan.

137
00:23:55,442 --> 00:23:58,102
Thank you, Osman Bey.

138
00:24:10,514 --> 00:24:12,464
Welcome, my Sultan.

139
00:24:13,491 --> 00:24:15,961
Thank you, Sheikh.

140
00:24:18,710 --> 00:24:22,360
You adorn Osman Bey's army.

141
00:24:22,743 --> 00:24:24,693
Thank you, my Sultan.

142
00:24:25,832 --> 00:24:29,302
Even though our hands are weak
because of the swords...

143
00:24:29,502 --> 00:24:32,532
our prayers are strong.

144
00:24:33,796 --> 00:24:37,296
Our prayers...

145
00:24:37,996 --> 00:24:40,456
are our strongest shields.

146
00:24:42,861 --> 00:24:44,151
Yes.

147
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:51,550
I know your situation.
We will win with Allah's help!

148
00:24:52,467 --> 00:24:56,787
Inshallah, my Sultan. La galibe illallah!
(There is no winner but Allah.)

149
00:24:57,719 --> 00:25:00,189
Let's go.

150
00:25:41,378 --> 00:25:44,418
Helen, did the support unit
and ammunition arrive?

151
00:25:45,123 --> 00:25:48,723
Yes, as you command.

152
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:51,550
The villagers are bringing supplies.

153
00:25:52,320 --> 00:25:55,720
Don't trust the villagers.
Don't let them enter the quarters.

154
00:26:04,062 --> 00:26:07,122
Sir, Sultan arrived in
the quarters with his army.

155
00:26:13,751 --> 00:26:16,731
Come and see, Sultan Mesud.

156
00:26:24,788 --> 00:26:27,588
The Byzantine quarters...
(headquarters/military quarter)

157
00:26:28,844 --> 00:26:31,634
will be behind the
Çarıklıtepe. (Çarıklı hill.)

158
00:26:32,220 --> 00:26:36,950
The Byzantine army will come to the
battlefield right this way.

159
00:26:39,895 --> 00:26:44,275
Here is the battlefield.

160
00:26:49,184 --> 00:26:55,514
What worries me is the ammunition
that the Byzantine emperor has sent.

161
00:27:00,123 --> 00:27:05,723
The Emperor has a good army.

162
00:27:06,666 --> 00:27:10,136
We have the ammunition
of Byzantine, my Sultan.

163
00:27:10,690 --> 00:27:12,420
Don't worry.

164
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:13,920
How?

165
00:27:14,675 --> 00:27:17,185
We checked every route
leading to the quarters.

166
00:27:17,431 --> 00:27:21,131
We located them and got it.

167
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:29,140
May Allah bless you, Osman Bey.
You saved us.

168
00:27:29,484 --> 00:27:31,414
Thank you, my Sultan.

169
00:27:33,040 --> 00:27:35,050
Thank you.

170
00:27:36,993 --> 00:27:38,893
However, I know that...

171
00:27:39,890 --> 00:27:45,090
Nikola is wise as he won't send the
ammunition with just one unit.

172
00:27:48,113 --> 00:27:52,113
My Sultan, it's big strike anyway.

173
00:27:54,859 --> 00:27:56,179
Then...

174
00:27:57,868 --> 00:28:01,998
tell me everything you
know about the enemy, Osman Bey.

175
00:28:02,702 --> 00:28:05,972
The Byzantine army consists of two units.

176
00:28:06,020 --> 00:28:08,640
Dukas' army...

177
00:28:08,952 --> 00:28:13,132
and the cavalry of Nikola.

178
00:28:40,607 --> 00:28:43,977
Malhun Hatun thinks you are her rival.

179
00:28:49,136 --> 00:28:51,326
I hope we are wrong.

180
00:28:54,227 --> 00:28:56,377
She doesn't know that I
can do everything...

181
00:28:56,999 --> 00:28:59,979
for my Osman Bey's child.

182
00:29:05,520 --> 00:29:07,730
My beautiful Bala.

183
00:29:11,987 --> 00:29:15,667
What will we do about Zoe, my Bala?

184
00:29:16,984 --> 00:29:18,804
If we are right...

185
00:29:20,345 --> 00:29:22,395
it may harm Osman Bey.

186
00:29:23,789 --> 00:29:25,549
We can't let that happen.

187
00:29:26,252 --> 00:29:30,252
- Watch her.
- Don't worry, my Bala.

188
00:29:30,798 --> 00:29:33,098
When our Bey and...

189
00:29:33,463 --> 00:29:35,993
Boran comes back...

190
00:29:37,429 --> 00:29:40,469
we will let them know.

191
00:29:55,705 --> 00:30:01,605
Dukas will come from the
quarters to the battlefield.

192
00:30:02,716 --> 00:30:06,416
He wants to circle us.

193
00:30:06,977 --> 00:30:11,817
Our commanders who have witnessed
situations like that are among us.

194
00:30:13,168 --> 00:30:15,268
Dukas is...

195
00:30:16,749 --> 00:30:20,479
strong in pitched battles.

196
00:30:22,044 --> 00:30:26,044
The Seljuqs army have
witnessed it so many times.

197
00:30:30,382 --> 00:30:33,082
How many soldiers we have from
the new comers, Nikola?

198
00:30:33,201 --> 00:30:34,711
350.

199
00:30:35,001 --> 00:30:37,911
Their military education is done.

200
00:30:47,869 --> 00:30:51,559
We will fight in order.

201
00:30:52,251 --> 00:30:55,671
We won't let Turks harm us.

202
00:31:00,019 --> 00:31:01,769
Dukas' biggest power is...

203
00:31:01,945 --> 00:31:05,475
his army who can use shield masterfully.

204
00:31:06,885 --> 00:31:10,885
The army we fight consists
of those people.

205
00:31:12,781 --> 00:31:15,731
I agree with you, Osman Bey.

206
00:31:16,200 --> 00:31:17,950
I will meet them in the center...

207
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:25,520
with my army who have shields.

208
00:31:27,838 --> 00:31:32,298
On the left-wing, there will be
Emir Arslan's soldiers.

209
00:31:34,185 --> 00:31:39,685
On the right-wing, you will fight there
with your Beys and Alps.

210
00:31:41,352 --> 00:31:45,352
The war will start tomorrow.

211
00:31:48,192 --> 00:31:52,192
We have so many soldiers, Commander Dukas.

212
00:31:53,035 --> 00:31:57,855
Osman trusts Sultan's army, and Sultan
trusts the Turk Beys' Alps.

213
00:31:57,945 --> 00:32:02,585
He will come with a strong army.
Osman holds himself in readiness.

214
00:32:03,057 --> 00:32:05,547
We will attack from three sides.

215
00:32:06,575 --> 00:32:09,025
The soldiers from Macedonia
will be in the center.

216
00:32:09,072 --> 00:32:11,382
I will control the soldiers
from the left-wing.

217
00:32:11,790 --> 00:32:15,800
Adnos will control the military units of
the governors on the right-wing.

218
00:32:17,747 --> 00:32:22,117
Nikola will be the support unit
with his own soldiers.

219
00:32:24,459 --> 00:32:29,359
It's an honor for me to fight next
to a big commander like you.

220
00:32:31,500 --> 00:32:35,110
What about you, Nikola? Is there
anything you will say?

221
00:32:35,933 --> 00:32:40,173
We outnumber them. We
are superior to them. However...

222
00:32:44,006 --> 00:32:47,166
if we don't think of
Turks' archers...

223
00:32:49,545 --> 00:32:52,385
we lose the war.

224
00:32:52,648 --> 00:32:54,568
What are your plans?

225
00:33:02,483 --> 00:33:05,003
Does anyone have a word to say?

226
00:33:05,542 --> 00:33:07,782
May our war be holy, my Sultan.

227
00:33:07,839 --> 00:33:10,719
May Allah help us.

228
00:33:11,180 --> 00:33:14,370
Amin.

229
00:33:17,368 --> 00:33:19,208
Osman Bey...

230
00:33:20,666 --> 00:33:22,376
I have things to say.

231
00:33:28,936 --> 00:33:34,386
I see that you have a strong
connection with the Beys.

232
00:33:35,034 --> 00:33:39,764
You manage them well.

233
00:33:40,840 --> 00:33:47,000
My Sultan, our lands are
under the Mongols' attack.

234
00:33:49,242 --> 00:33:50,902
My Beys know that...

235
00:33:52,034 --> 00:33:57,584
if our unity is ruined, we will not
only lose...

236
00:33:57,790 --> 00:34:01,790
but also we will fall apart.

237
00:34:02,311 --> 00:34:06,441
We will win, Inshallah.

238
00:34:06,648 --> 00:34:11,428
They would know if they saw your Ghazis...

239
00:34:11,938 --> 00:34:13,297
who are very eager to fight.

240
00:34:13,371 --> 00:34:17,202
Inshallah, my Sultan.
Inshallah.

241
00:34:32,199 --> 00:34:34,438
Can I come in, Osman Bey?

242
00:34:34,592 --> 00:34:37,181
Come in, brother.

243
00:34:42,715 --> 00:34:44,574
Come and sit.

244
00:34:50,322 --> 00:34:54,322
Osman Bey, I looked at the
Alps as you command.

245
00:34:54,929 --> 00:34:59,789
They are ready and eager to fight.

246
00:35:00,303 --> 00:35:03,903
Thank you, brother.

247
00:35:32,473 --> 00:35:38,133
Thank Allah that you are happy
as you will have a child.

248
00:35:40,761 --> 00:35:43,331
Inshallah, everything will
be good, brother.

249
00:35:44,276 --> 00:35:49,456
Amin, brother.
Amin.

250
00:35:51,743 --> 00:35:56,133
There are others as well who are happy
to know that you will be a father.

251
00:35:57,978 --> 00:35:59,318
Yes.

252
00:35:59,560 --> 00:36:02,830
All Muslims and non-Muslims
in the tents, villages...

253
00:36:02,940 --> 00:36:06,940
are so happy.

254
00:36:08,283 --> 00:36:11,053
Do you know why?

255
00:36:11,237 --> 00:36:15,337
Because they see their
future in you, Osman Bey.

256
00:36:17,674 --> 00:36:21,224
In you and in your children who will born.

257
00:36:28,222 --> 00:36:30,392
Everything we do for Allah...

258
00:36:31,817 --> 00:36:34,707
is also for our children and descendants.

259
00:36:35,983 --> 00:36:41,053
- May Allah bless them.
- Amin, brother.

260
00:36:48,760 --> 00:36:49,910
Brother.

261
00:36:50,388 --> 00:36:52,198
I have to do something...

262
00:36:54,336 --> 00:36:56,346
if you excuse me.

263
00:36:57,912 --> 00:37:01,082
Come on, do it.

264
00:37:01,289 --> 00:37:03,429
Thank you.

265
00:37:09,559 --> 00:37:11,749
Come on.

266
00:37:28,078 --> 00:37:30,048
Be careful.

267
00:37:33,057 --> 00:37:37,057
I looked for you the other day.

268
00:37:37,573 --> 00:37:39,843
You had a job to do.

269
00:37:40,022 --> 00:37:42,302
Tell me, I can do that my Hanım.

270
00:37:43,044 --> 00:37:47,044
It was an easy one.
Where were you that day?

271
00:37:50,705 --> 00:37:53,565
I was going to the draper....

272
00:37:56,704 --> 00:37:59,074
but I went to the church.

273
00:38:01,931 --> 00:38:06,581
I gave the money you gave me
for my service to the Pope.

274
00:38:08,320 --> 00:38:09,700
Why?

275
00:38:13,689 --> 00:38:15,989
I said why, Zoe.

276
00:38:16,693 --> 00:38:19,913
We donate the church for the
children who will be born.

277
00:38:21,007 --> 00:38:22,587
It's a tradition.

278
00:38:23,050 --> 00:38:28,670
We pray and light a candle on behalf of
Mother Mary for the child to be healthy.

279
00:38:31,220 --> 00:38:32,920
The child?

280
00:38:34,988 --> 00:38:38,088
I prayed for your child.

281
00:38:39,771 --> 00:38:43,381
Everyone is looking at you.
You call that Nazar. (evil eye)

282
00:38:43,431 --> 00:38:44,961
We call that Mati.

283
00:38:45,593 --> 00:38:48,063
You carry a burden.

284
00:38:48,141 --> 00:38:51,291
Why would my child be a burden, Zoe?

285
00:38:51,643 --> 00:38:54,003
It has an evil eye on it.

286
00:38:55,357 --> 00:38:57,697
You attract Nazar.

287
00:39:00,846 --> 00:39:04,016
May God protect her from Nazar.

288
00:39:07,839 --> 00:39:11,359
You attract Nazar from people
around Osman Bey.

289
00:39:12,933 --> 00:39:15,173
Especially...

290
00:39:20,903 --> 00:39:25,343
I also prayed to Mother Mary for Osman Bey
to come back from the war safe and sound.

291
00:39:26,255 --> 00:39:29,955
Just for Osman Bey?

292
00:39:32,233 --> 00:39:35,673
No one protected me ever.

293
00:39:36,040 --> 00:39:39,190
I also prayed for my Bey who protected me...

294
00:39:39,260 --> 00:39:42,600
and for my Hanım's Alps.

295
00:40:49,436 --> 00:40:50,586
Amin.

296
00:41:12,962 --> 00:41:16,962
Bismillahirrahmanirrahîm. (In the name
of Allah, the Merciful, the Compassionate)

297
00:42:10,446 --> 00:42:13,636
May my Lord let you back in our tent...

298
00:42:14,165 --> 00:42:17,405
with our child, my Bey.

299
00:42:30,378 --> 00:42:32,838
Osman!
Osman!

300
00:42:52,642 --> 00:42:54,533
You are back, Osman Bey.

301
00:42:54,533 --> 00:42:56,833
I wanted to see you before the war.

302
00:42:57,037 --> 00:43:00,037
I am so glad you did.
Welcome.

303
00:43:02,160 --> 00:43:04,310
How is our child?

304
00:43:05,346 --> 00:43:07,276
Good, thanks to Lord.

305
00:43:10,501 --> 00:43:12,581
I am fine too, Osman Bey.

306
00:43:13,253 --> 00:43:15,173
Of course you are.

307
00:43:15,345 --> 00:43:18,835
You should be good so that our child
can be good.

308
00:43:26,864 --> 00:43:30,064
I'll heat water.
You shall rest.

309
00:43:32,437 --> 00:43:36,097
Malhun Hatun, thank you.

310
00:43:37,023 --> 00:43:39,323
But I have to go back.

311
00:43:40,112 --> 00:43:42,612
Are you going back in nigh time?

312
00:43:43,146 --> 00:43:46,856
It's full moon.
My horse will find his way.

313
00:43:47,893 --> 00:43:49,813
You know what you need to do.

314
00:43:54,075 --> 00:43:57,855
I would love to fight by your side in
this war.

315
00:43:58,408 --> 00:44:01,288
You are already giving the
greatest fight...

316
00:44:01,785 --> 00:44:03,985
my Lord mentioned.

317
00:44:04,917 --> 00:44:07,067
Yes, right.

318
00:44:10,553 --> 00:44:14,603
Malhun Hatun, get rest.

319
00:44:15,175 --> 00:44:18,415
Protect yourself and our child.

320
00:44:19,286 --> 00:44:21,736
Don't worry Osman Bey.

321
00:44:21,835 --> 00:44:23,915
We'll be fine.

322
00:44:24,234 --> 00:44:28,224
Our child is entrusted to Allah first,
then to me.

323
00:44:28,666 --> 00:44:30,696
May your fight be blessed.

324
00:45:04,340 --> 00:45:06,540
Osman Bey is here.

325
00:45:07,364 --> 00:45:09,204
He is going to his tent.

326
00:47:09,223 --> 00:47:17,003
Allah is the greatest. x4

327
00:47:19,207 --> 00:47:28,467
I bear witness that there is
no god except the One Allah. x2

328
00:47:30,411 --> 00:47:41,641
I bear witness that Muhammad
is the messenger of Allah. x2

329
00:47:42,602 --> 00:47:45,582
Hurry to the prayer.

330
00:47:45,592 --> 00:47:47,144
What are they doing?

331
00:47:47,809 --> 00:47:51,589
- Hurry to the prayer.
- What every Turk does before war, Ducas.

332
00:47:54,456 --> 00:47:57,426
- Hurry to salvation.
- They are seeking help from their god.

333
00:47:57,828 --> 00:48:01,947
Hurry to salvation.

334
00:48:01,947 --> 00:48:04,457
There is only one place
they'll go to, Niicola.

335
00:48:05,946 --> 00:48:09,016
Under the soil where
they are going to rot.

336
00:48:09,075 --> 00:48:13,635
Prayer is better than sleep.

337
00:48:14,492 --> 00:48:16,962
Allah is the greatest. x2

338
00:48:17,509 --> 00:48:21,659
There is no god except the One Allah.

339
00:48:23,578 --> 00:48:25,768
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

340
00:48:48,941 --> 00:48:51,171
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

341
00:48:53,049 --> 00:48:56,519
“Allah hears whoever praises Him.”

342
00:48:58,022 --> 00:49:00,852
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

343
00:49:03,914 --> 00:49:05,984
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

344
00:49:08,593 --> 00:49:10,993
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

345
00:49:12,821 --> 00:49:15,741
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

346
00:49:29,315 --> 00:49:33,185
"May the peace, mercy, and blessings of
Allah be with you."

347
00:49:35,030 --> 00:49:38,450
"May the peace, mercy, and blessings of
Allah be with you."

348
00:50:13,696 --> 00:50:17,746
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

349
00:51:09,313 --> 00:51:13,603
You have to suffer to get the victory!

350
00:51:13,816 --> 00:51:17,006
We came here through the bloody paths!

351
00:51:17,057 --> 00:51:20,867
We are going to drown
Turks in their blood!

352
00:51:21,475 --> 00:51:26,205
If a soldier leaves fighting and starts
thinking...

353
00:51:26,992 --> 00:51:29,862
no one will be left alive in the army!

354
00:52:04,096 --> 00:52:07,536
My Allah, raise the flag of Islam!

355
00:52:07,536 --> 00:52:09,906
- Help us.
- Amin.

356
00:52:19,016 --> 00:52:25,376
Grant your valiants with your support
that fills our tents with security...

357
00:52:26,410 --> 00:52:29,640
You strenghten the warriors who fight
for your name...

358
00:52:29,799 --> 00:52:34,529
We sacrifice ourselves in your path,
we obey you all the time.

359
00:52:35,278 --> 00:52:37,378
Amen!

360
00:54:23,206 --> 00:54:25,506
Byzantine's brave sons!

361
00:54:25,527 --> 00:54:29,637
I order you to die, not to think!

362
00:54:30,079 --> 00:54:33,687
Death is a honor for us.

363
00:54:33,687 --> 00:54:37,827
Losing without fighting is a dishonor.

364
00:54:40,407 --> 00:54:42,327
Victory...

365
00:54:42,669 --> 00:54:44,819
is with us!

366
00:54:45,215 --> 00:54:51,245
Victory is with us!
Victory is with us!

367
00:55:15,522 --> 00:55:19,462
Oh our Lord!
You are our trustee...

368
00:55:20,185 --> 00:55:24,955
we smooth our faces over the ground
for you...

369
00:55:25,766 --> 00:55:28,666
we fight in your name.

370
00:55:31,114 --> 00:55:33,289
Bless our war.

371
00:55:33,289 --> 00:55:34,679
Amen!

372
00:55:53,106 --> 00:56:04,836
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

373
00:57:15,792 --> 00:57:20,542
I am the one who trapped you, Osman Bey.

374
00:57:23,257 --> 00:57:26,697
I'll kill Leo after the war.

375
00:58:18,117 --> 00:58:20,347
Save your swords!

376
00:58:20,878 --> 00:58:23,488
Go forward!

377
00:59:09,909 --> 00:59:12,159
Attack!

378
00:59:12,957 --> 00:59:15,897
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

379
00:59:15,923 --> 00:59:19,053
Allah-u Akbar.
(Allah is the greatest.)

380
01:00:41,379 --> 01:00:43,819
Beat the drum!

381
01:01:16,883 --> 01:01:19,133
Alps!

382
01:01:23,377 --> 01:01:25,639
We are retreating!

383
01:01:25,639 --> 01:01:29,229
Retreat!
Retreat!

384
01:01:29,254 --> 01:01:31,854
Hurry!
Retreat!

385
01:01:51,561 --> 01:01:56,861
They are retreating! We should
retreat too. We'll finish them tomorrow.

386
01:01:57,557 --> 01:02:01,217
Soldiers!
We are retreating!

387
01:02:01,296 --> 01:02:03,246
Retreat!

388
01:02:04,023 --> 01:02:06,253
Retreat!

389
01:02:14,771 --> 01:02:16,751
Retreat!

390
01:02:17,276 --> 01:02:18,916
Retreat!

391
01:03:07,471 --> 01:03:09,535
This should have been done today!

392
01:03:09,535 --> 01:03:12,137
We should have pushed them
when they were retreating.

393
01:03:12,137 --> 01:03:14,181
We had to scatter to chase them.

394
01:03:14,181 --> 01:03:19,591
A scattered army is the only thing
Osman wants.

395
01:03:20,233 --> 01:03:22,393
Isn't this right, Yason?

396
01:03:25,569 --> 01:03:29,339
Which one of you have better soldiers
than his alps?

397
01:03:30,093 --> 01:03:32,123
None of you!

398
01:03:33,112 --> 01:03:35,414
Do not counsel!

399
01:03:35,414 --> 01:03:37,751
We are not going to change our formation!

400
01:03:37,751 --> 01:03:41,561
If we change our position, we'll be
hunted by Osman!

401
01:03:42,790 --> 01:03:45,350
Sultan's army made it harder.

402
01:03:45,533 --> 01:03:48,516
As Commander Ducas said, we'll finish this
tomorrow.

403
01:03:48,516 --> 01:03:52,219
If we can't finish it tomorrow,
they'll end us.

404
01:03:52,219 --> 01:03:54,319
How can you talk like that?

405
01:03:54,541 --> 01:03:56,191
Enough!

406
01:03:59,787 --> 01:04:03,047
It is no use to argue now!

407
01:04:05,483 --> 01:04:07,503
It's not about Sultan and his army.

408
01:04:08,802 --> 01:04:11,772
The issue is Osman.
Osman!

409
01:04:14,605 --> 01:04:16,605
Didn't you realise that?

410
01:04:20,555 --> 01:04:24,315
We have to defeat him by attacking
in the right wing.

411
01:04:25,585 --> 01:04:28,075
You are still talking about Osman.

412
01:04:28,137 --> 01:04:32,692
Ducas, didn't you say Osman's alps
are fighting better than our soldiers?

413
01:04:32,692 --> 01:04:36,422
Right! But we have regular army.

414
01:04:36,422 --> 01:04:38,782
Sultan's army is tired.

415
01:04:39,967 --> 01:04:44,407
They have come a long way from Konya.

416
01:04:44,681 --> 01:04:46,951
They'll be more tired tomorrow morning.

417
01:04:47,445 --> 01:04:51,195
Do not abandon yourselves in despair!
We'll finish it tomorrow morning.

418
01:04:52,885 --> 01:04:54,685
Do you understand me?

419
01:05:20,432 --> 01:05:22,782
We couldn't outclass each other.

420
01:05:23,553 --> 01:05:25,173
My army is tired.

421
01:05:26,387 --> 01:05:29,237
Once we ruin Ducas' formation...

422
01:05:29,491 --> 01:05:31,641
then our alps will hunt them.

423
01:05:31,654 --> 01:05:35,244
We'll manage that
if Allah permits, my Sultan

424
01:05:38,326 --> 01:05:42,156
You haven't give them a chance thanks to
your braveheart and ambition.

425
01:05:43,948 --> 01:05:45,458
That formation...

426
01:05:47,515 --> 01:05:49,135
will break.

427
01:05:49,927 --> 01:05:52,117
I have no doubt, Osman Bey.

428
01:05:57,390 --> 01:05:59,530
My Sultan, excuse me.

429
01:06:23,818 --> 01:06:28,548
Karamanogullari are moving towards Konya.

430
01:06:30,106 --> 01:06:33,706
If I do not go back to Konya
to stop them...

431
01:06:34,306 --> 01:06:36,056
Konya will fall.

432
01:06:36,327 --> 01:06:39,747
If I go back, you are going to be
weak...

433
01:06:41,085 --> 01:06:42,825
against Byzantine.

434
01:06:47,009 --> 01:06:52,849
If you go back, the fate of the
war will change, my Sultan.

435
01:07:02,164 --> 01:07:04,564
What do you think, Osman Bey?

436
01:07:05,311 --> 01:07:06,941
My Sultan...

437
01:07:08,159 --> 01:07:13,539
The situation requires that you go back
to Konya.

438
01:07:14,018 --> 01:07:17,668
How will you manage to defeat Ducas and
Nicola, Osman Bey?

439
01:07:24,010 --> 01:07:27,221
With my Beys,
with my Ghazis...

440
01:07:27,221 --> 01:07:32,211
we are going to do what we have to do
to break Ducas.

441
01:07:34,445 --> 01:07:35,615
However...

442
01:07:40,297 --> 01:07:42,627
If you don't go back to Konya...

443
01:07:43,546 --> 01:07:46,366
That may be a bigger
problem for the state.

444
01:07:49,743 --> 01:07:51,343
I'll go back.

445
01:07:54,705 --> 01:07:59,515
I am giving the whole authority
to Osman Bey.

446
01:08:06,415 --> 01:08:09,435
I won't be worrying myself, Osman Bey.

447
01:08:11,887 --> 01:08:16,705
From now on, both my sword
and the honor of our state...

448
01:08:16,705 --> 01:08:20,085
are in your hands, Osman Bey.

449
01:08:44,448 --> 01:08:46,268
My Sultan.

450
01:09:14,394 --> 01:09:16,304
Alps!

451
01:09:17,198 --> 01:09:21,438
I am not your Bey today.

452
01:09:21,866 --> 01:09:25,685
Your Bey will be fighting by your side...

453
01:09:26,267 --> 01:09:29,886
in the name of Allah!

454
01:09:31,593 --> 01:09:33,863
This is going to be a rough war..

455
01:09:34,810 --> 01:09:37,001
If you love your life...

456
01:09:37,694 --> 01:09:40,005
If you miss your family...

457
01:09:40,313 --> 01:09:42,483
Go back now.

458
01:09:47,113 --> 01:09:50,383
Here is the field, here is the
fierce enemy for those...

459
01:09:50,640 --> 01:09:52,901
who want to fight!

460
01:09:54,612 --> 01:09:59,072
You should know that until I end up
with either shahada or victory...

461
01:09:59,934 --> 01:10:03,604
I will not leave the battlefield!

462
01:10:04,748 --> 01:10:31,698
Either shahada or victory!
Either shahada or victory!

463
01:10:31,804 --> 01:10:57,284
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest)

464
01:11:02,952 --> 01:11:06,692
They are going to die shouting
their god's name!

465
01:11:17,886 --> 01:11:20,756
Sultan is going back to Konya
but Osman didn't give up.

466
01:11:20,969 --> 01:11:23,019
He never gives up.

467
01:11:23,257 --> 01:11:24,757
Never.

468
01:11:25,844 --> 01:11:29,354
A bloody victory is waiting
for us, Nicola.

469
01:12:15,930 --> 01:12:18,390
Let's see where you are going...

470
01:12:18,624 --> 01:12:20,824
what you are doing in secret, Zoe.

471
01:12:22,986 --> 01:12:25,136
I'll learn eventually, Zoe.

472
01:13:05,833 --> 01:13:07,003
Come on.

473
01:13:16,212 --> 01:13:19,852
Alps!
Attack!

474
01:14:53,964 --> 01:14:58,584
Sultan is leaving with his army. This
is not a hopeful war now.

475
01:15:00,279 --> 01:15:04,549
It is impossible to fight against Byzantine
with a bunch of alps we have.

476
01:15:04,999 --> 01:15:06,749
Wait a bit.

477
01:15:06,999 --> 01:15:10,139
Osman Bey will arrive.
He must have something to say.

478
01:15:10,295 --> 01:15:11,765
Be patient.

479
01:15:19,057 --> 01:15:24,667
Nicola and Ducas must have already
learned that...

480
01:15:25,822 --> 01:15:28,152
Sultan left with the army.

481
01:15:30,605 --> 01:15:34,645
We are going to fight with Turan Tactic.

482
01:15:36,401 --> 01:15:42,481
I am going to attack with my alps in the
shape of arrow in frontline.

483
01:15:45,684 --> 01:15:50,544
Gunduz Bey and Umur Bey will not be
in the battlefield.

484
01:15:54,751 --> 01:16:00,521
However, we are going to change the
fate of this war.

485
01:16:04,323 --> 01:16:08,823
Are you going to attack a huge Army
with a bunch of alps, Osman Bey?

486
01:16:10,028 --> 01:16:16,338
I am going to retreat when the fight
starts.

487
01:16:19,328 --> 01:16:22,058
And we'll break Byzantine's formation.

488
01:16:22,430 --> 01:16:26,700
The bloodshed will be red!

489
01:16:29,476 --> 01:16:32,996
Alps!
Attack!

490
01:16:36,539 --> 01:16:38,019
Attack!

491
01:16:59,456 --> 01:17:00,786
Cover!

492
01:17:04,447 --> 01:17:06,657
Finally Osman!

493
01:17:06,784 --> 01:17:08,794
Finally!

494
01:17:10,832 --> 01:17:13,801
I see you turn tail and run!

495
01:17:13,801 --> 01:17:17,031
I'll hang you in your tail in Sogut!

496
01:17:19,056 --> 01:17:20,906
Wait.

497
01:17:22,622 --> 01:17:24,582
Wait.

498
01:17:26,916 --> 01:17:28,576
Wait.

499
01:17:40,307 --> 01:17:42,597
Do not let them away!

500
01:17:43,097 --> 01:17:45,387
Attack!

501
01:17:54,137 --> 01:17:57,257
Cavalries, forward!

502
01:18:02,431 --> 01:18:04,341
Finally, Osman.

503
01:18:04,974 --> 01:18:06,614
Finally.

504
01:18:19,185 --> 01:18:22,955
Gündüz Bey will attack in the left wing.

505
01:18:45,883 --> 01:18:49,863
Umur Bey will attack in the right wing.

506
01:18:50,762 --> 01:18:52,422
Also...

507
01:18:53,538 --> 01:18:55,788
Also, you are not going to be alone.

508
01:19:10,996 --> 01:19:13,086
Where did they come from?

509
01:19:31,038 --> 01:19:32,848
Sultan is back in Konya.

510
01:19:33,770 --> 01:19:38,040
However, he left some of his soldiers
under my order.

511
01:19:39,585 --> 01:19:43,372
We are going to encircle them with...

512
01:19:43,372 --> 01:19:47,872
We are going to use Turan Tactic(pincer
movement) against Byzantine.

513
01:19:47,872 --> 01:19:50,998
We are going to let Nicola see
hell while he's alive!

514
01:19:58,692 --> 01:20:00,222
It was a trap!

515
01:20:00,898 --> 01:20:02,478
It was a trap!

516
01:20:08,608 --> 01:20:10,668
Nicola!

517
01:20:15,410 --> 01:20:17,690
Dishonored dog!

518
01:20:19,139 --> 01:20:20,709
Nicola!

519
01:20:23,822 --> 01:20:27,002
- Cover the lord!
- Cover the lord!

520
01:20:27,065 --> 01:20:28,405
Get in the position!

521
01:20:51,314 --> 01:20:53,824
Attack!

522
01:21:16,618 --> 01:21:18,838
It's time, my Bey.

523
01:21:28,180 --> 01:21:29,610
Alps!

524
01:21:30,185 --> 01:21:34,005
Attack now!

525
01:21:51,279 --> 01:21:52,619
Attack!

526
01:23:03,367 --> 01:23:05,517
She went in this street before, Bala.

527
01:23:05,638 --> 01:23:07,968
I lost her track later though.

528
01:23:08,427 --> 01:23:10,337
So, this is where she has
been going.

529
01:23:10,555 --> 01:23:11,975
Let's chase.

530
01:23:12,226 --> 01:23:13,666
Wait a while.

531
01:23:38,609 --> 01:23:39,959
It's ready, Zoe.

532
01:23:40,527 --> 01:23:46,877
I stored it a long time, like wine,
just like how Nicola wanted.

533
01:23:47,211 --> 01:23:52,421
I made it in my uterus like a infertile
mother who is yearning for a child.

534
01:24:06,363 --> 01:24:10,093
It is going to be born in your
dexterious hands.

535
01:24:10,965 --> 01:24:13,925
When you open and pour it to the meal...

536
01:24:14,360 --> 01:24:17,610
it'll leave no sign in behind.

537
01:24:18,648 --> 01:24:24,188
Nobody will know why Malhun Hatun's
child is dead.

538
01:24:24,578 --> 01:24:27,868
Neither will they know she died aftermath.

539
01:24:29,807 --> 01:24:32,391
She is not going to die as soon as
she swallow, is she?

540
01:24:32,391 --> 01:24:34,061
Her baby will die first.

541
01:24:38,529 --> 01:24:42,919
Such a woman like Malhun Hatun should
experience the grief of losing a child

542
01:24:43,303 --> 01:24:45,733
with Osman Bey before she dies.

543
01:24:45,965 --> 01:24:48,125
Of course she sould
experience that feeling.

544
01:24:51,127 --> 01:24:53,697
I'll bury their pain in my body.

545
01:24:53,807 --> 01:25:00,157
At the end, Malhun will die like
a crushed bug.

546
01:25:00,568 --> 01:25:05,978
If Osman kisses those beautiful lips...

547
01:25:07,299 --> 01:25:09,619
Osman will die too.

548
01:25:47,570 --> 01:25:49,310
What are we going to do, Bala?

549
01:28:06,328 --> 01:28:09,888
What's it?
You said you came to shed our blood.

550
01:28:13,586 --> 01:28:16,356
We won't let you get away before
you try to shed our blood.

551
01:28:17,526 --> 01:28:20,066
- Right, brother?
- Right.

552
01:28:20,089 --> 01:28:22,209
We won't.

553
01:28:25,324 --> 01:28:28,944
I'll give your bodies to my dogs
in the castle.

554
01:28:29,417 --> 01:28:32,527
Let's see how you do that, freaking Lord!

555
01:28:34,233 --> 01:28:36,173
You'll turn will come too.

556
01:30:46,361 --> 01:30:47,961
Turanalp!

557
01:30:49,424 --> 01:30:51,844
Hold on!
Turanalp!

558
01:30:52,166 --> 01:30:54,706
Hold on!
Hold on!

559
01:31:04,345 --> 01:31:06,935
Shahada sherbet is...

560
01:31:09,338 --> 01:31:11,188
very sweet, I understand it now.

561
01:31:16,519 --> 01:31:20,679
"I bear witness that none
deserves worship except Allah, ...

562
01:31:22,750 --> 01:31:31,460
and I bear witness that Muhammad
is the messenger of Allah."

563
01:31:46,683 --> 01:31:51,553
He came for shahada, he reached
his goal.

564
01:31:53,808 --> 01:31:55,808
He is a martry.

565
01:33:00,084 --> 01:33:02,394
Thank my Lord.

566
01:33:04,010 --> 01:33:09,030
When you die, there will be spring in
the land you spoiled!

567
01:33:10,628 --> 01:33:15,618
You are going to die like your father's
goals did.

568
01:33:16,908 --> 01:33:18,888
Come here once.

569
01:33:19,557 --> 01:33:20,877
Come here.

570
01:33:21,827 --> 01:33:27,197
I'll show you Turks won't stop until
we get freedom!

571
01:34:07,718 --> 01:34:11,918
Turks never stop!

572
01:34:45,393 --> 01:34:47,163
Enjoy your meal, Malhun Hatun.

573
01:34:47,520 --> 01:34:49,080
Wait.

574
01:34:51,463 --> 01:34:53,443
Sit here.

575
01:34:55,736 --> 01:34:59,096
We can talk.
I don't want to eat alone.

576
01:35:07,480 --> 01:35:10,230
You got tired all day.

577
01:35:10,505 --> 01:35:12,945
Eat now, then you'll rest.

578
01:35:17,841 --> 01:35:20,771
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

579
01:35:48,823 --> 01:35:51,333
What are you waiting for?
Eat.

580
01:36:11,573 --> 01:36:13,773
Can I come in, Malhun Hatun?

581
01:36:18,318 --> 01:36:20,428
Come in Bala Hatun!

582
01:36:30,012 --> 01:36:31,632
Hi there.

583
01:36:34,943 --> 01:36:37,343
Bala Hatun, what are you doing?

584
01:36:40,600 --> 01:36:42,700
Eat!

585
01:36:46,557 --> 01:36:48,697
I said eat, Zoe!

586
01:36:50,220 --> 01:36:52,150
What does that mean Bala Hatun?

587
01:36:53,035 --> 01:36:54,865
I said eat it.

588
01:36:57,591 --> 01:36:59,771
What are you doing Bala Hatun.

589
01:37:00,101 --> 01:37:02,741
This woman wants to poison you.

590
01:37:03,111 --> 01:37:05,131
She poured venom in your meal.

591
01:37:07,789 --> 01:37:09,749
She's lying.

592
01:37:11,683 --> 01:37:15,793
You can eat it if you are telling the truth.

593
01:37:15,860 --> 01:37:18,100
Otherwise I know what to do!

594
01:37:52,080 --> 01:37:53,330
She obtained this poison...

595
01:37:53,907 --> 01:37:58,637
which would kill you and my Bey's child
from a healer woman in Sogut.

596
01:38:02,723 --> 01:38:04,343
Zoe wanted to give it to you.

597
01:38:14,982 --> 01:38:17,082
Ah!
What are you doing?

598
01:38:18,992 --> 01:38:22,426
What is happening?
Let me go! I am an old woman!

599
01:38:22,486 --> 01:38:25,156
Tell me what you are after with Zoe.

600
01:38:25,222 --> 01:38:27,920
Or I'll cut your throat.

601
01:38:27,920 --> 01:38:30,085
Please don't. let me go.

602
01:38:30,085 --> 01:38:31,635
Talk!

603
01:38:37,754 --> 01:38:41,234
We caught the woman who prepared
the poison and put her in the caged tent

604
01:38:47,665 --> 01:38:49,435
What is your intention?

605
01:38:49,445 --> 01:38:52,435
Who are you working for?
Who made you do this?

606
01:38:52,986 --> 01:38:54,556
Nicola!

607
01:39:02,525 --> 01:39:04,955
Poor orphan girl, huh?

608
01:39:09,604 --> 01:39:12,504
You disappointed me Zoe.

609
01:39:18,765 --> 01:39:22,185
Gonca, put her in the caged tent too.

610
01:39:36,747 --> 01:39:37,977
Come here.

611
01:39:38,869 --> 01:39:39,599
Sit.

612
01:39:49,317 --> 01:39:52,647
It's over.
Keep calm.

613
01:39:53,352 --> 01:39:56,322
Osman Bey will punish them
when he is back.

614
01:39:58,474 --> 01:40:00,484
I didn't believe you.

615
01:40:01,848 --> 01:40:04,478
I thought you were being jealous.

616
01:40:08,697 --> 01:40:10,607
I was such a fool.

617
01:40:13,363 --> 01:40:17,573
If it weren't for you,
we'd lose our child.

618
01:40:25,954 --> 01:40:27,794
Malhun Hatun.

619
01:40:31,260 --> 01:40:33,970
Your child is my child too.

620
01:40:34,489 --> 01:40:36,389
Always remember this.

621
01:40:41,402 --> 01:40:42,972
Let being jealous aside...

622
01:40:43,785 --> 01:40:46,555
I'd burn the whole world for your child.

623
01:40:51,184 --> 01:40:54,084
We are not only Osman Bey's Hatuns...

624
01:40:54,207 --> 01:40:57,137
and his soldiers to die in his path...

625
01:40:58,393 --> 01:41:01,463
We are also the mothers of a glorious
state to be found.

626
01:41:06,411 --> 01:41:09,361
Do not forget this.

627
01:42:40,584 --> 01:42:41,894
Nicola!

628
01:42:45,856 --> 01:42:50,006
Thank God!
Are you okay?

629
01:42:50,759 --> 01:42:53,346
Helen, Helen, Ducas...

630
01:42:53,346 --> 01:42:55,796
where are the others?

631
01:42:56,151 --> 01:43:01,361
Ducas, Aknos, Yason, Feritles
all are dead!

632
01:43:02,109 --> 01:43:07,619
Did Ducas die with his freaking
arrogance?

633
01:43:07,675 --> 01:43:10,515
He repeated "Victory, victory, victory"

634
01:43:10,549 --> 01:43:14,819
He gave us a massive defeat!

635
01:43:29,362 --> 01:43:30,932
Helen...

636
01:43:32,533 --> 01:43:38,073
Osman hit Emperor hard, Helen.

637
01:43:39,096 --> 01:43:41,536
But there is something they don't know.

638
01:43:41,536 --> 01:43:46,806
Both Emperor and his impertinent son
need me now!

639
01:43:49,146 --> 01:43:51,273
A new era is starting.

640
01:43:51,324 --> 01:43:54,913
I am stronger than ever before!

641
01:43:54,923 --> 01:43:56,883
I am stronger now.

642
01:44:08,042 --> 01:44:09,612
Helen.

643
01:44:10,328 --> 01:44:15,158
Set off.
You'll arrive in the castle by the morning.

644
01:44:15,220 --> 01:44:17,110
On foot.

645
01:44:17,205 --> 01:44:19,425
On foot.

646
01:44:19,428 --> 01:44:21,018
Nicola!

647
01:44:26,206 --> 01:44:28,426
Nicola!

648
01:44:40,411 --> 01:44:44,771
Osman Bey is coming!
Osman Bey is coming!

649
01:44:46,829 --> 01:44:51,519
Osman Bey is coming!
Osman Bey is coming!

650
01:44:51,687 --> 01:44:54,337
Osman Bey is coming!

651
01:44:54,499 --> 01:44:58,999
My Bey is coming!

652
01:44:59,041 --> 01:45:02,881
Masha Allah! (praise be)

653
01:45:03,732 --> 01:45:06,632
Masha Allah! (praise be)

654
01:45:10,337 --> 01:45:16,834
You didn't disappointed me with the
swords I made for you!

655
01:45:20,756 --> 01:45:24,156
O Allah, I beg to You

656
01:45:24,416 --> 01:45:27,116
the good which

657
01:45:27,159 --> 01:45:30,889
Your Prophet Muhammad (ﷺ)
begged of You

658
01:45:30,899 --> 01:45:33,319
Masha Allah! (praise be)

659
01:46:16,053 --> 01:46:17,603
Today...

660
01:46:18,447 --> 01:46:21,017
we fought for our future.

661
01:46:22,396 --> 01:46:24,836
Thank my Lord...

662
01:46:24,964 --> 01:46:31,144
we are back in Ertugrul Ghazi's tent
with victory!

663
01:46:31,468 --> 01:46:35,590
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

664
01:46:35,590 --> 01:46:40,790
This victory is all of ours!

665
01:46:42,220 --> 01:46:49,092
It is the victory of mothers who send
their Beys, their valiant sons to war...

666
01:46:49,092 --> 01:46:55,200
It is the victory of scholar elders!

667
01:46:58,203 --> 01:47:00,993
This is your victory!

668
01:47:04,463 --> 01:47:09,513
This victory is the preview
of a glorious state...

669
01:47:10,082 --> 01:47:15,712
under whose flag
the Islam will gather up

670
01:47:23,226 --> 01:47:27,881
However, always remember this.

671
01:47:27,881 --> 01:47:30,801
It is always harder to protect a recently
conquered land...

672
01:47:30,965 --> 01:47:35,123
thank conquering a new place!

673
01:47:35,123 --> 01:47:39,353
So, with our factories that we'll build...

674
01:47:39,717 --> 01:47:42,057
with our mosques in which we'll pray...

675
01:47:42,316 --> 01:47:45,566
with the whole future of ours...

676
01:47:45,636 --> 01:47:48,596
We are going to make this land our state.

677
01:47:48,664 --> 01:47:52,014
We watered this land with our blood!

678
01:47:52,562 --> 01:47:55,872
The state we are going to found...

679
01:47:56,479 --> 01:47:58,879
will be fighting for justice!

680
01:47:59,380 --> 01:48:04,570
We will not stand back in front
of injustice!

681
01:48:05,260 --> 01:48:09,600
Our state shall be everlasting with
our community...

682
01:48:09,674 --> 01:48:14,414
and our justice in Allah's name!

683
01:48:22,398 --> 01:48:25,118
May Allah bless you.

684
01:48:25,648 --> 01:48:28,058
May Allah bless you.

685
01:48:34,069 --> 01:48:36,941
You conquered the enemy with your sword.

686
01:48:36,941 --> 01:48:39,771
You conquered the hearts
with your justice.

687
01:48:42,466 --> 01:48:44,575
With this victory...

688
01:48:44,575 --> 01:48:49,635
you changed the fate of a whole community,
Osman Bey.

689
01:48:51,520 --> 01:48:56,570
Thank you Master Davut.
Thank you.

690
01:48:57,952 --> 01:49:00,332
Ahmet Alp.

691
01:49:14,927 --> 01:49:18,217
Thank lord you are back safe and sound.

692
01:49:18,652 --> 01:49:21,872
Thank you Hatun.

693
01:49:21,878 --> 01:49:23,237
I hope you are fine.

694
01:49:23,237 --> 01:49:26,167
I am, don't worry.

695
01:49:30,311 --> 01:49:33,316
Thank Lord you are back safe
and sound, father.

696
01:49:33,316 --> 01:49:37,356
I am yearning for a grandchild, daughter.
How can I not come back?

697
01:49:44,864 --> 01:49:47,404
Masha Allah! (praise be)

698
01:49:51,178 --> 01:49:53,948
Masha Allah! (praise be)

699
01:50:10,933 --> 01:50:13,763
Your victories shall never end, Osman Bey.

700
01:50:14,006 --> 01:50:17,666
Thank you Malhun Hatun.

701
01:50:22,957 --> 01:50:24,787
Thank you Bala.

702
01:50:26,431 --> 01:50:29,581
Thank Lord that we see these days.

703
01:50:31,804 --> 01:50:36,334
Your happiness circled our tent.

704
01:50:36,748 --> 01:50:38,998
May Allah keep you with us, my Bey.

705
01:50:50,857 --> 01:50:52,867
I married twice.

706
01:50:54,490 --> 01:50:56,530
As I saw you together...

707
01:50:58,688 --> 01:51:03,188
this is your victory too.

708
01:51:08,770 --> 01:51:10,630
Thank my Lord.

709
01:51:15,058 --> 01:51:16,808
Osman Bey.

710
01:51:17,573 --> 01:51:20,503
We want to talk to you
if you are available, my Bey.

711
01:51:23,321 --> 01:51:25,161
Of course.

712
01:51:25,666 --> 01:51:27,586
Let's talk.

713
01:51:40,556 --> 01:51:42,316
- My Bey.
- My Gonca.

714
01:51:43,172 --> 01:51:45,552
- Welcome.
- Thank you.

715
01:51:46,268 --> 01:51:48,328
Thank Lord you are back safe and sound.

716
01:51:48,974 --> 01:51:50,874
May our war be blessed.

717
01:51:51,127 --> 01:51:52,687
Amin.

718
01:52:05,365 --> 01:52:08,035
What are you thinking like a little owl?

719
01:52:10,368 --> 01:52:15,298
I was thinking if my share of the booty
would be enough for your dowery or not.

720
01:52:16,434 --> 01:52:18,556
How about that?

721
01:52:18,556 --> 01:52:20,866
You are a dark horse!

722
01:52:26,056 --> 01:52:28,626
Who is that lucky Hatun?

723
01:52:29,138 --> 01:52:31,318
Tell me, I want to learn.

724
01:52:37,884 --> 01:52:39,294
She is someone...

725
01:52:41,534 --> 01:52:45,800
...who doesn't realise
how valiant she is...

726
01:52:49,101 --> 01:52:51,471
She is the Sultan of my heart.

727
01:53:11,954 --> 01:53:13,354
Alaca Hatun.

728
01:53:14,980 --> 01:53:17,220
Where is Zoe?
I couldn't see her.

729
01:53:18,225 --> 01:53:20,155
Do you know where she is?

730
01:53:24,639 --> 01:53:26,149
Tell me.

731
01:53:27,702 --> 01:53:31,052
Bala Hatun saved our child's life.

732
01:53:32,884 --> 01:53:36,784
You saved both Malhun Hatun's and
our child's life.

733
01:53:38,456 --> 01:53:40,516
May Allah bless you Bala Hatun.

734
01:53:43,001 --> 01:53:45,871
What is going to happen to that old woman
and Zoe, my Bey?

735
01:53:46,048 --> 01:53:48,948
What happens to the babykillers
will happen to them!

736
01:54:05,203 --> 01:54:06,833
Goktug!

737
01:54:50,189 --> 01:54:52,309
To my Bey's Hatun...

738
01:54:54,934 --> 01:54:57,174
with a baby in her belly, huh?

739
01:55:01,848 --> 01:55:03,988
What a snake you are!

740
01:55:12,977 --> 01:55:14,857
What is going to happen to me?

741
01:55:29,912 --> 01:55:32,432
You'll die by the poison you made!

742
01:55:33,169 --> 01:55:35,089
No! No!

743
01:55:38,945 --> 01:55:41,245
Do not hamper Alps!

744
01:55:43,665 --> 01:55:45,125
Eat and...

745
01:55:47,134 --> 01:55:48,764
die!

746
01:55:58,279 --> 01:55:59,599
Goktug!

747
01:56:02,269 --> 01:56:04,069
Save me.

748
01:56:06,156 --> 01:56:08,296
Save me!

749
01:56:10,660 --> 01:56:16,030
Goktug! Do not leave, my Goktug!
Do not leave me alone!

750
01:56:18,103 --> 01:56:20,383
Goktug!

751
01:56:32,812 --> 01:56:34,602
Masha Allah! (praise be)

752
01:56:43,020 --> 01:56:44,990
Salam Aleikum
(peace be upon you).

753
01:56:45,034 --> 01:56:48,064
Alaikum Salam
(you too) Osman Bey.

754
01:56:48,205 --> 01:56:49,935
Welcome.

755
01:56:56,916 --> 01:56:58,666
Thank you.

756
01:56:58,801 --> 01:57:00,091
Here.

757
01:57:07,162 --> 01:57:12,832
Your eyes are lightened by a divine light.

758
01:57:13,290 --> 01:57:15,350
Osman Bey.

759
01:57:16,886 --> 01:57:22,006
Like how you waited with patience for
your child to born...

760
01:57:22,278 --> 01:57:26,108
Both the birth of your child that
you waited in patience...

761
01:57:26,108 --> 01:57:28,978
... and the state you wanted to found
are coming.

762
01:57:28,978 --> 01:57:32,218
Inshallah, Inshallah.
(If Allah permits).

763
01:57:33,392 --> 01:57:35,492
Even if I am left alone...

764
01:57:36,084 --> 01:57:40,024
As Ertugrul Ghazi's son Osman Bey...

765
01:57:40,349 --> 01:57:45,719
I'll die fighting in the name of Allah.

766
01:57:48,394 --> 01:57:53,304
Your patience, your ambition, your faith...

767
01:57:53,662 --> 01:57:56,072
made you a scholar.

768
01:57:57,732 --> 01:58:00,522
Thank you, thank you.

769
01:58:01,181 --> 01:58:05,241
In the war you fought against Byzantine...

770
01:58:05,718 --> 01:58:10,838
the wind of the victory of yours was your...

771
01:58:11,452 --> 01:58:14,192
biggest supporter.

772
01:58:14,235 --> 01:58:18,205
It relieved your community, Osman Bey.

773
01:58:18,870 --> 01:58:20,420
Eyvallah (thank you).

774
01:58:21,648 --> 01:58:23,428
Eyvallah (thank you).

775
01:58:24,068 --> 01:58:28,558
Not only this wind helped you
gather all the Turks in your land...

776
01:58:28,680 --> 01:58:33,320
But also the towns, the cities
the tents of yours developed.

777
01:58:35,960 --> 01:58:41,250
I hope I and my breed can conquer
lots of towns and...

